  / jamesblunt  \nInstagram:   / jamesblunt  \nTik Tok:   / jamesblunt  \n\nAbout James Blunt:\nJames Blunt is an internationally acclaimed multi-million selling artist known for his powerful performances, distinctive voice and a knack for crafting melodic, contemporary pop songs. \n \nHis catalogue includes 2004's 'Back to Bedlam', which became the one of the best selling albums of the Noughties, as well as albums All The Lost Souls, Some Kind Of Trouble, Moon Landing, The Afterlove and Once Upon A Mind, which have spawned hits such as 'You're Beautiful', 'Goodbye My Lover', 'Wisemen', '1973', 'Stay The Night', 'Bonfire Heart', and ‘Monsters\n\n#JamesBlunt #YoureBeautiful #BackToBedlam","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":368,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBgQ040EGAYiEwjp1IWZ9cKWAxVjBFUIHeCmNHBIm8WSjezT9MOiAcoBBAeEcKU=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUmpueGVLUVlSMi1qS2F3SmpIQ2E0aXxBR3JiS2FtenFsV2dZWFZqMi1Qa0s0RnVtbkFla19scmk3NklMRjlfMk5ZRXJHS19Gb2JWODZUYVc4NXY5V0IxN2k0TFRpbzMyZTVvZEhuaW5xbDlPMnc2M1BBTUYyV19TblB6\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fatlantic.lnk.to%2FJamesBluntSubscribe\u0026v=oofSnsGkops","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUmpueGVLUVlSMi1qS2F3SmpIQ2E0aXxBR3JiS2FtenFsV2dZWFZqMi1Qa0s0RnVtbkFla19scmk3NklMRjlfMk5ZRXJHS19Gb2JWODZUYVc4NXY5V0IxN2k0TFRpbzMyZTVvZEhuaW5xbDlPMnc2M1BBTUYyV19TblB6\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fatlantic.lnk.to%2FJamesBluntSubscribe\u0026v=oofSnsGkops","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":463,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBgQ040EGAYiEwjp1IWZ9cKWAxVjBFUIHeCmNHDKAQQHhHCl","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_lsRQUwZEe2CE78HUlhoJd-Uth_t7aGDyw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_PLAYLIST","rootVe":5754,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/